msgid ""
"[How filings build on earlier ones](../explanation/building-on-earlier-"
"filings.md) - how cross-period dependencies work."
msgstr ""
"[Com les presentacions es basen en les anteriors](../explanation"
"/building-on-earlier-filings.md): com funcionen les dependències entre "
"períodes."

